    "intro_html":  "This one starts on the stovetop and finishes under the broiler, which means no long bake and no heating the whole house in August. Rice simmered in broth, smoked turkey sausage browned in with zucchini, peppers, corn and onion, a cheddar sauce poured over the top and blistered. Each serving runs {{cal}} calories with \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). Fresh basil at the end is what keeps it from tasting like every other cheesy rice dish.",
